      "sc:description": "FACT is a trainable clustering framework designed for spatial transcriptomics. It unifies multiple strategies (ACT, FACT, Scatter, Ensemble) and uses autoencoder-driven feature learning with Mclust-assisted clustering for joint optimization of representation and cluster assignment.",
